  "rule": "Every Membrane collateral sale draws on one shared book per (chain, token): at most 1.1 x capacity tokens in any rolling 10 minutes, where CAPACITY is the most tokens that left liquidated borrowers in any rolling 10 minutes of 10-11 Oct on that chain, over every Aave V3 and Morpho Blue liquidation of the census (Aave: liquidatedCollateralAmount + the protocol fee; Morpho: seized assets). Capacity is a rate, available at any minute. Sales draw in order minute, then pid. A sale's unfilled part stays pending and sells at later minutes at those minutes' prices, never past the borrow cap (lib/wavefront/kernel.ts PENDING ORDERS). Debt repayment is not limited; only collateral sales are.",
